crets of fly-fishing with me dad you'd  be so proud of me  so this is how you back cast just try it  guns lungs of the whole it back slowly  and then snap it forward going great  good this is a well sometimes people  have beginner's luck and catch a huge  fish the first time they try you just  never know but I wasn't so lucky the  last stop on my second trip was X book  I was especially impressed with a Fugazi  one of the world's oldest social housing  complexes it was established back in the  early 16th century by local merchants  jakob fuga who had it built for people  in need the major takeaway from my first  two visits to the Romantic Road there  really is no limit to what you can see  and discover
 

